CAN I DISABLE CLOUD BACKUP?

CAN I USE MY OWN KEY?

WHAT HAPPENS AFTER YOUR OWN BREACH?

HOW FAST MUST YOU NOTIFY ME?

DO YOU PROVIDE FORENSIC LOGS?

WHO OWNS THOSE LOGS?

CAN YOU PROVE WHICH FILES WERE ACCESSED?

Those should become standard security-vendor questions.

